不让它们穿过。

78
00:04:45,060 --> 00:04:47,060
Then we have beta particles.
然后是 β 粒子。

79
00:04:47,060 --> 00:04:50,060
Beta particles are stopped by your layer of clothing
β 粒子会被你的一层衣服挡住，

80
00:04:50,060 --> 00:04:54,060
