it's unlikely that the hospital during an emergency situation
医院在紧急情况下就不太可能

180
00:10:04,940 --> 00:10:06,940
would know that that person had received
知道这个人曾经接受过

181
00:10:06,940 --> 00:10:09,940
a radioactive injection.
放射性注射。

182
00:10:09,940 --> 00:10:12,940
PPE is an extremely important part
PPE 是极其重要的一部分，

183
00:10:12,940 --> 00:10:16,940
and would normally be worn during an emergency situation
在紧急情况下通常都会穿戴，

184
00:10:16,940 --> 00:10:18,940
and should provide adequate protection
并且应该能对放射性

185
00:10:18,940 --> 00:10:21,940
